					<tr>
						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#743">Just thought I should make this front page news.</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							I am sorry to say, but I had to transfer leadership to Obam, since new events in real life regarding the military have come to pass, I feel it is necessary to hand down my leadership of the guild. I have been involuntarily transferred to a more high priority unit, and more highly deployable. I cannot be prepared enough to handle a situation fast enough if I get called away, and be able to deal with the guild. I don't want to see it deteriorate because of me. I am just going to play day by day and deal with things as they come, remember, grow wisely, and grow strong, adhere to the standards that we live by, and teach others the wisdom that resides within you all. Keep things alive, and live life like there is no tomorrow. Just be responsible. I am sure I will see you from time to time, and I wish you all the best. I know this was last minute, but my time was running short. Be safe, and hunt well.<br />
-Wandira<br />
<br />
-----------------------------------------------<br />
<br />
<br />
I just wanted to move this to the front page. Please show her your support next time you see her on. <br />
<br />
Please take care Wan. We will miss the fun and levity you brought to the game. Good luck, just come home safe if you leave!<br />
<br />
-Brahim
						</td>
					</tr>
