						<td class="body">
							Hey all, just wanted to drop a line to let everyone know I'll be on and off on the weekends, you see I'm working out of town and living in a camper trailer durring the week. My puter in in the trailer and I'm driving home on weekends, so till I get 1 setup at home (and my daughters pushin for that, Lol) I just wont be on much on weekends. Still luv ya though, hehe.<br />
FYI all.<br />
Rod
