					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="2" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#685">Website and Officer Help.</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Hail Shadows!! First off let me say that in the short amount of time i've been able to play lately I have noticed tremendous growth in the guild!! Congratz to Wandira and all the of the officers (and members) that have been recruiting so strong! <br />
<br />
I have come up with a general design and built a basic website for us. Now that we've grown a bit this may be a good time to put the call out for help again! If there is anyone that can help out a bit with finishing the construction of the site please let me know. I basically need to set up access and make it updatable for multiple users (techies out there know what i'm talking about). So far I can't seem to find any open content code to drop in and make multiple user access and managment possible. If there are any part-time web development peeps out there, or maybe its just a hobby, shoot me some suggestions on good sources or informative sites to hunt some code down.<br />
<br />
Lastly, although I haven't been able to get in the game much lately I am still available to pop in and out to help out with things. RL has been kickin my butt lately but its quieting down a bit now. I'm checking the Brahim account more regularly now so shoot me an email at bibadbrahim@hotmail.com<br />
<br />
Exciting days lie ahead! Let the names of Shadows ring loud throughout Norrath!!
						</td>
					</tr>
