					<tr>
						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#651">A new place to post</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							I Created our guild on WWW.guildmagic.com.  You can also register your characters there.  There are some new features that differ from this one, with a little more info, and places to find out about other characters.  At that site, you can list your keys, awards received, invite friends that may be listed there as looking for guild, etc.  We will still use this one, and post raid/party info here. I subitted some invites to people who are looking for a home.  Hopefully we will get some responses. If you know someone that needs a home, talk to them about joining us.  Our officers are there to help out.  I want to tell all of you that you are doing a great job, and continue to honor the name.
						</td>
					</tr>
