					<tr>
						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#644">Guild meeting</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Very soon i the upcoming week or so, we will have a guild meeting.  I need all my officers to attend, and all my members.  If you see someone on, give the reminder that we are going to do this.  There are some issues I would like to discuss.  This is the time to bring your complaint sheet while everyone is together.  If you also have ideas for something, bring them too.  This is a mandatory meeting.  I know there are a few people as of late that are handling some real life issues.  I understand that.  As an officer's job, it is their duty to pass this info along when they see them.  take notes in case you have to help out a fellow guildie if an officer isn't on.  We must follow our simple rules.  It's not like we have that many and it is not hard to do. Also, I am glad to announce that we have several new members that joined recently, so when you see them, make sure they feel welcome. Brahim still also needs help with his new website production if there is anyone who wants to help with it and knows about creation.  The general format is already made at this point.
						</td>
					</tr>
