					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							We need help! Any ultra saavy website designers whether it be amateur or pro out there? We are putting together a new site of our very own and i need someone who knows how to get in and tweak some html to help out. Let me know if you are interested in helping build it. This is a chance to have influence on the way our site represents us. You would basically be working with me, tossing ideas around and helping with the construction. Don't sweat it, it will be a fun and casual commitment. Email me bigbadbrahim@hotmail.com
						</td>
