						<td class="body">
							There are several positions open that we would like to invite anyone to volunteer for if they are interested. We need masters in all tradeskills. I don't  mean that you have to be a master right now but we would like you to start practicing up to be the master at any specialty that you like. We need a Master Smith, Brewer, Tailor, Alchemist, Potter, Fletcher, etc etc.. I hope that these persons wil also act as bankers for the specific skills that they will be mastering. The Treasury will be able to help out with the expenses. Reply to the board thread for Masters if you're interested.<br />
<br />
Officers- As you probably already know we are going to designate 2 Treasurers. One will probably be myself (or an alt) and i strongly feel that another officer should volunteer to be the 2nd. Let me know if any of you are interested. Email me at bigbadbrahim@hotmail.com<br />
